{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_008_01_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f8f92b5554a9eac7931f4929216f9ed71cd4ed41d0811c4d1c2426d8333376d0",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:741bb1c603d76da23bd4f03cf1e617b85bb1495712bcbe3cd739e97c7e6d1410",
      "text": "我有点懂这种心情。我初中为止\n也是普普通通混过来的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d09a63979841733b1c2d951e93dbd85112d4d8332c055e1d5ceb0bc07e2949b5",
      "text": "我也是我也是！整天不是懒洋洋地看漫画，\n就是去买零食吃，或者再看漫画……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:883fd197d5e5af1b91be614b4fa8c3df047150682e0b229f46795a49dfe9dfa4",
      "text": "所以高中我想做出改变。\n把青春奉献给乐队！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:378dbe47df2b00bdd22762867ad4556884283a6100494e7081cc2cc29a718696",
      "text": "这么说，旬亲和夏来亲也是\n为了挥洒青春才加入社团的吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3fbf84139df5acbffdc043b78c67734563a3c14fb21ba840977adac3775eeae9",
      "text": "并不是。\n我只是被隼人拉过来，顺其自然加入的而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0315aa7a9cb17c888fb97bc08838e731094d32b393c320ba9c9ded655d1b68ec",
      "text": "我也是……\n那个……是被旬，拉过来的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90d422a359a5eb8a4b856669017cb34e313d675cd8715fe2ee7d768627097709",
      "text": "他们两个人是青梅竹马，关系可好啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ac5764ffcfa76cf710ba251d1640cb00f662d764d95e56bffda3e6d9e41962c",
      "text": "哦，“青梅竹马”……！\n这不就超级无敌有青春感嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ffb5d2360e63bad2f1da2d16eeef40bd71bbc74d0f1047a33b2911d596a65a0",
      "text": "超级无敌，很有青春感……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c57c11a8acf07f9b2986ee423469130b3ff15fb99c8fd1fda5157fa8b01ae16",
      "text": "而且，夏来超级崇拜\n旬的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd19161a245b5bf7b74279fae432dbbe527da7deb9d1e0ba7a0c71daa00ca4ed",
      "text": "……嗯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59804378bb77b31586a3b0abb6290a8dbbca3da812ef88ad20e25f2add532fcc",
      "text": "呜呜……感觉好耀眼啊！\n我也要为了成为那样的伙伴而努力！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e393c22460c49d223d9938085255c6a865c6219cefb2fb3de376462e9e20e82f",
      "text": "耶，轻音部！情绪高涨起来，\n让我们把团队默契拉满吧～～！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000142:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a43dc73e802af3bce94468ce41aa574cf898e4bc12c735bdb19f913d5ca90212",
      "text": "感觉……变热闹了，呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_01_1_1_008_01:1_1_008_01_h:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95576d317dd668ad6b1fdfb0c25463059c8f0b7f648dac39b5d91ac50ec8c32f",
      "text": "……夏来，这种程度应该叫吵闹了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
